            <p class="text-brand-dark/70 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
              Upon arrival at Ngurah Rai Airport, your driver will meet you after baggage collection with a name board. The driver will assist with luggage and escort you to your vehicle before beginning the journey to Nusa Dua.
            </p>
            <p class="text-brand-gold text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mb-3">This Service Is Especially Useful For</p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
              {[
                'First-time visitors to Bali',
                'Families with children',
                'Business and conference travellers',
                'Wedding groups',
                'Late-night arrivals',
                'Early-morning flights'
              ].map((item) => (
                <div class="bg-white p-4 text-brand-dark/70 text-sm">{item}</div>
